<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-PONTYPRIDD WIN WELSH CHAMPIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-PONTYPRIDD WIN WELSH CHAMPIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pontypridd beat Neath 60-19 (halftime 17-12) in the final of the Welsh Champions Cup on Sunday.</p>
</text>
